Module::Starter::Plugin::MyGuts

This plugin is a subclass of Module::Starter::Simple that replaces some of
its *_guts methods with my preferred settings, thus not intended for public
usage. Inspired by Module::Starter::Plugin::Template.

Note that only ExtUtils::MakeMaker and single author are supported for
simplicity.


INSTALLATION

To download and install this module, use your favorite CPAN client:

    cpanm Module::Starter::Plugin::MyGuts

To do it manually, run the following commands (after downloading and unpacking
the tarball):

    perl Makefile.PL
    make
    make test
    make install


SUPPORT AND DOCUMENTATION

After installing, you can find documentation for this module with the perldoc
command:

    perldoc Module::Starter::Plugin::MyGuts

You can also look for information at:

    GitHub issue tracker (report bugs here)
        https://github.com/ryoskzypu/Module-Starter-Plugin-MyGuts/issues

    Search CPAN
        https://metacpan.org/dist/Module-Starter-Plugin-MyGuts


